OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786877293
OL,3,CRail boss calls for more funding to
OL,4,Ctackle climate change after two
OL,5,Cderailments
OL,7,FExtra funding could be needed to help
OL,8,Fthe railway cope with the impact of
OL,9,Fclimate change, a Network Rail boss
OL,10,Fsaid after two train derailments
OL,11,Fduring the heatwave.
OL,13,FInvestigations into the derailments
OL,14,Fare looking at all possible causes,
OL,15,Fbut officials have acknowledged that
OL,16,Fhot weather has presented the railway
OL,17,Fwith a series of challenges.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
