OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786877293
OL,3,CRail boss calls for more funding to
OL,4,Ctackle climate change after two
OL,5,Cderailments
OL,7,FMartin Frobisher, group safety and
OL,8,Fengineering director at Network Rail
OL,9,Fsaid the investigations into the
OL,10,Fincidents in Essex and East Sussex
OL,11,Fwill be "looking at climate and all
OL,12,Fsorts of other issues".
OL,14,FA Greater Anglia train derailed on
OL,15,FFriday south of Wickford railway
OL,16,Fstation in Essex, while an incident at
OL,17,FLewes on Thursday seriously injured
OL,18,Ftwo passengers.
OL,26,@sD@IOUtD@VO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
