CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786877293
OL,3,CRail boss calls for more funding to
OL,4,Ctackle climate change after two
OL,5,Cderailments
OL,7,FMr Frobisher told BBC Radio 4's Today:
OL,8,F"We don't yet know the full facts and
OL,9,Freasons for those derailments, but a
OL,10,Fvery detailed investigation is under
OL,11,Fway and we'll be getting to the bottom
OL,12,Fof it.
OL,14,F"And clearly, we'll be looking at
OL,15,Fclimate and all sorts of other issues
OL,16,Fas factors."
OL,18,FHe said there was "lots that we can
OL,19,Fdo" to make the railway more resilient
OL,20,Fto climate change.
OL,26,@pD@AOUvD@AOUxD@LO]zD@SOU{D@CO]
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786877293
OL,3,CRail boss calls for more funding to
OL,4,Ctackle climate change after two
OL,5,Cderailments
OL,7,FThere were "lots of challenges" with
OL,8,Felectronic signalling equipment and
OL,9,Fthe heat, while in winter there was a
OL,10,Fneed to ensure the stability of
OL,11,Fembankments in the face of rain and
OL,12,Fstorms.
OL,14,F"We're in the process now of putting
OL,15,Ftogether our case for our next five-
OL,16,Fyear funding cycle and we'll be making
OL,17,Fa very strong case for climate
OL,18,Fresilience," he said.
OL,20,F"There's a lot we've done already.
OL,26,@oD@LOUoD@_O]vD@AOUzD@LO]|D@AOU
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
FL,386,380,120,260,000,100
PN,38505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F385A1786877293
OL,3,CRail boss calls for more funding to
OL,4,Ctackle climate change after two
OL,5,Cderailments
OL,7,F"This funding control period that
OL,8,Fwe're in right now, we have #1.6
OL,9,Fbillion that we're spending on climate
OL,10,Fresilience.
OL,12,F"There's more that we need to do in
OL,13,Fthe future.
OL,15,F"We're modelling that in a very
OL,16,Ftechnical way, so as to make the best
OL,17,Fpossible case for funding in the
OL,18,Ffuture."
OL,26,@oD@AOUtD@AOUwD@AOUzD@HO]
